  prompt                            text only  billed  difference
  one short message                        10      16          +6
  a system prompt and a question           17      27         +10
  ten turns of conversation               135     187         +52
  one question and one tool                10     147        +137
  one question and four tools              10     254        +244

  (the tool's JSON schema, as text, is 72 tokens)

Every message carries a few tokens of framing that its text does not show. Tools
add more than their text: the first brings a fixed preamble with it, and each further
one adds its definition in the provider's own format — on every call, used or not. A
budget that counts only message text is short by both, and the second grows with
each tool. Count from the provider's usage figures once, and budget with the margin.
